<title>JAPAN: SANYO ELECTRIC CREDIT TO LIST SHARES ON TSE.</title>
<headline>SANYO ELECTRIC CREDIT TO LIST SHARES ON TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Friday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Sanyo Electric Credit Co Ltd on the second section of the exchange.</p>
<p>The company is likely to be listed on September 11 and it plans to issue 1.0 million new shares, the TSE said.</p>
<p>The company, which is currently traded on the second section of the Osaka Securities Exchange, is a leasing and credit company.</p>
<p>It is a subsidiary of Sanyo Electric Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
